# The Library opens as a drawer: the sidebar widens to the drawer (about 400 pt) and the docked
# card moves right with it at its own size (942 wide before and after), so the window and the page
# never resize or reflow (Arc, 10 Nov 2026). Opened over a hidden sidebar it comes out in the
# floating sidebar, the card staying put, and leaves the sidebar hidden when it closes; it never
# docks the sidebar (ShellView.drawerWidth, MainWindowController.showLibrary). ⇧⌘L closes it
# directly, with no slide past the tab list (closeLibraryDirectly).
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
wait 2
cra://debug?windowState=before
expect-log window state before: main0 .*size=1280x800 card=328,10,942,780 docked=1 floating=0 drawer=0 library=-
cra://action/showArchive
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=open
expect-log window state open: main0 .*size=1280x800 card=400,10,942,780 docked=1 floating=0 drawer=400 library=archive
cra://action/openLibrary
wait 1
expect-log library closes directly
cra://debug?windowState=closed
expect-log window state closed: main0 .*card=328,10,942,780 docked=1 floating=0 drawer=0 library=-
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://action/showArchive
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=hiddenOpen
expect-log window state hiddenOpen: main0 .*card=10,10,1260,780 docked=0 floating=1 drawer=400 library=archive
# The pointer off the floating sidebar: ⇧⌘L takes the sidebar away with the Library in it.
cra://debug?pointerOnSidebar=0
cra://action/openLibrary
wait 1.5
expect-log library closes directly with the floating sidebar
cra://debug?windowState=hiddenClosed
expect-log window state hiddenClosed: main0 .*card=10,10,1260,780 docked=0 floating=0 drawer=0 library=-
# The pointer on it: ⇧⌘L slides the Library back to the space as its ← does, the floating sidebar
# staying out at the sidebar's width (11 Nov 2026: the drawer narrowed over it and cut it in half).
cra://action/showArchive
wait 1.5
cra://debug?pointerOnSidebar=1
cra://action/openLibrary
expect-log library slides back in the floating sidebar
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=hiddenSlidBack
expect-log window state hiddenSlidBack: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1 drawer=0 library=-
cra://debug?pointerOnSidebar=0
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=0
wait 1
# The floating sidebar going away with the Library in it takes the Library too, out of sight: the
# next reveal is the space's tabs, not the Library again (10 Nov 2026).
cra://action/showArchive
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=hiddenReopen
expect-log window state hiddenReopen: main0 .*docked=0 floating=1 drawer=400 library=archive
cra://debug?floatingSidebar=0
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=hiddenGone
expect-log library closed with the floating sidebar
expect-log window state hiddenGone: main0 .*card=10,10,1260,780 docked=0 floating=0 drawer=0 library=-
